        <div class="powerup-name">SOFTWARE<br>ENGINEERING</div>
        <div class="powerup-desc">Building robust systems and applications from the ground up. Backend logic, cloud architecture, and clean code that scales.</div>
        <div class="powerup-tags">
          <span class="tag">PYTHON</span><span class="tag">C/C++</span><span class="tag">C#</span><span class="tag">JAVA</span><span class="tag">JAVASCRIPT</span><span class="tag">TYPESCRIPT</span><span class="tag">CLOUD (AZURE/AWS/GCP)</span>
